// # Five println string statements
//
// Logline: Print five string literals so emit-wasm can plant all five texts.
//
// Setup: One public main. Body is only five println(STRING) statements.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Print line-a through line-c.
//   2. Print line-d and line-e.
//   3. Leave no other statements.

pub fn main() {
    println("line-a");
    println("line-b");
    println("line-c");
    println("line-d");
    println("line-e");
}
